      "location": "§9",
      "proposalQuote": "EarnStride offers modular enhancements that can be enabled at the State’s direction, including: • Employer bulk onboarding",
      "explanation": "Offering unrequested add-on modules creates ambiguity about what is covered under base pricing versus optional future costs.",
      "fix": "Remove the optional add-on modules section or explicitly designate them as future enhancements outside the current scope."
