      "proposalQuote": "Sanghi’s work constitutes an estimated 10% of the total bid price (final percentage determined upon completion",
      "explanation": "Failing to state concrete dollar amounts or an explicit pricing table prevents the State from evaluating the commercial proposal.",
      "fix": "Provide a complete, binding cost table listing explicit dollar figures for all prime and subcontractor components."
    }
  ],
